config ZMK_BEHAVIOR_HRM_HOLD_TAP
    bool "Home-row-mod hold-tap behavior (one-row-mod)"
    default y
    help
      Adds zmk,behavior-hrm-hold-tap: a hold-tap tailored to the
      home-row-mod scheme used by this module (same-hand tap,
      same-hand HRM mods locked until the hand's last hold releases,
      and reverse mod sequences).
